# scripts/ TypeScript

Dev automation only — not app runtime, not a production API. Official docs: [Cursor TypeScript SDK](https://cursor.com/docs/sdk/typescript).

- Node **22.13+**, **npm**, **tsx**, ESM + `module`/`moduleResolution`: `NodeNext`. **Not Bun.**
- Pin `@cursor/sdk` (e.g. `^1.0.25`); never `"latest"`
- Local: `local: { cwd: repoRoot, settingSources: [] }`
- Cloud: explicit `cloud.repos[]`, `autoCreatePR: true`, `skipReviewerRequest: true`
- Exit codes: 1 = startup error, 2 = run error, 0 = success
- Never commit `CURSOR_API_KEY` or `scripts/.env`
- Exhaustive `switch` on unions: `default` must assign `never`

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
await Agent.create({ apiKey, local: { cwd: process.cwd() } }); // wrong cwd; unpinned sdk

// ✅ GOOD
const repoRoot = resolve(dirname(fileURLToPath(import.meta.url)), "../../..");
await using agent = await Agent.create({
  apiKey,
  local: { cwd: repoRoot, settingSources: [] },
});
```
